# Deployed face embedding model (QAT distill_v2 ReLU6 128D) — versioned on purpose.
# The previous deployed model was silently caught by *.tflite above and never
# committed, so firmware could not be rebuilt from a clean checkout. Keep this one.
!model_zoo/tflm_face_embedding/qat_distill_v2_relu6_128d/
!model_zoo/tflm_face_embedding/qat_distill_v2_relu6_128d/*.tflite
